      "id": 1350033,
      "name": "[Tsukishiro Yanagi] Moonblade Shadow Pursuit",
      "desc": "When any squad member triggers <color=#FFFFFF>Disorder</color>, Tsukishiro Yanagi gains 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>Shadow Pursuit</color>, stacking up to 3 times. When the active character's heavy attack hits an enemy, if Tsukishiro Yanagi has <color=#FFFFFF>Shadow Pursuit</color>, it will automatically consume 1 stack to execute 1 instance of <color=#FFFFFF>Graceful Dance</color> against the enemy. <color=#FFFFFF>Graceful Dance</color> is an <color=#FFFFFF>Aftershock</color> and can be triggered once every 1s.",
